  // seat_lock_set_lockout_until(state_ptr, deadline_nsec) -> u64 status.
  //
  // Stamps word2 with a monotonic-clock deadline. Called by the
  // lockout-scheduler landing after observing unlock_attempts >=
  // SL_MAX_UNLOCK_ATTEMPTS. This module never reads the clock itself,
  // so the deadline arrives from outside. Passing deadline_nsec == 0
  // is legal and clears the lockout (equivalent to "no back-off").
