  // Refuses SL_NULL_STATE (state_ptr == 0) and SL_NOT_INIT (word4 == 0);
  // does NOT refuse when the seat is unlocked (a lockout can be pre-
  // stamped ahead of a future engage). Labels prefixed seat_lock_sl_.
